      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEXAS BANNER NZ (8) is building into his campaign nicely. Came from the back row for fourth here two back then worked and was beaten less than 7m at his latest appearance at Pinjarra. The driver has some work to do from this starting position but he should be hitting his peak now. PATRIARCH NZ (5) saluted as a hot favourite two back at Pinjarra before a midfield finish in the Battle of Bunbury six-and-a-half weeks ago. Freshened but kept ticking over with a trial. Two-time winner here and this race should suit. CINCH NZ (7) should find this easier than the latest attempt and was racing well with a series of placings prior so is worth another chance. NOT SO SWEET (3) could be close to a win after filling a minor placing at this circuit and distance last start.",
